{0 PangoCairo interfaces}

{!Ocpangocairo} has one module for each PangoCairo interface, with the externals they are built on in {!Ocpangocairo.Raw} and the enumerations and bitfields in {!Ocpangocairo.Enums}. See {%html:<a href="../ocgtk/conventions.html">the conventions page</a>%} for how the bindings are organised: the two layers, the anatomy of a class module, and how names, types, signals and properties are mapped.

{1 Interfaces}

{!modules:
  Ocpangocairo.Font
  Ocpangocairo.Font_map
}
